              ]
            }
          ],
          "INC-SPECT": [
            {
              "pointer": "",
              "coded_information": null,
              "free_text": [
                "The microwave cusp ion source (MWIS) at the Off-Line",
                "Ion Source (OLIS) was used to produce a beam of 21Ne",
                "from a gas source, which was accelerated with the",
                "superconducting linear accelerator (SC-LINAC) to",
                "deliver a 165 MeV beam with an intensity of 5*10**8",
                "particles per second (pps)."
              ]
            }
          ],
          "DETECTOR": [
            {
              "pointer": "",
              "coded_information": [
                "SI",
                "HPGE",
                "SPEC"
              ],
              "free_text": [
                " The Silicon Highly segmented Array for",
                "Reactions and Coulex (SHARC) is a charged-particle",
                "spectrometer embedded within the target chamber for",
                "this experiment. In addition, the downstream box",
                "offers dE-E through a box of backing MSX35",
                "single-area detectors. Surrounding SHARC, TIGRESS",
                " (TRIUMF-ISAC Gamma-Ray Escape-Suppressed",
                "Spectrometer) was used to measure the gamma rays",
                "emitted from the ejectile 22Ne."
              ]
            }
          ],
          "SAMPLE": [
            {
              "pointer": "",
              "coded_information": null,
              "free_text": [
                "A 120 microg/cm2 deuterated polyethylene (CD2) target",
                "at the center of the combined SHARC/TIGRESS",
                "measurement station."
              ]
            }
          ],
          "METHOD": [
            {
              "pointer": "",
              "coded_information": [
                "EDE"
              ],
              "free_text": [
                " A 165 MeV beam of 21Ne was delivered to a",
                "deuterated polyethylene (CD2) target, resulting in the",
                "population of an excited 22Ne nucleus and a recoil",
                "proton. This reaction mechanism was studied with two",
                "surrounding complementary arrays: SHARC, a segmented",
                "silicon array for measurement of recoil particles, and",
                "TIGRESS, a high-purity, segmented germanium clover",
                "array for measurement and correction of",
                "Doppler-shifted gamma rays."
              ]
            }
          ],
